swa Indonesia\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://tugasmu.com\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"TugasMu\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"id_ID\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"TugasMu | AI yang ngerti pelajaran kamu\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Platform AI Gratis untuk Bantu Belajar Siswa Indonesia\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"font-sans bg-brand-cream text-brand-navy flex flex-col min-h-screen __variable_0d7163 __variable_5667dc\"><header class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 w-full\"><div class=\"bg-brand-cream/95 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-brand-navy/10\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-16 flex items-center justify-between\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 group\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-brand-navy flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm group-hover:bg-brand-lime transition-colors duration-300\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 fill-brand-cream group-hover:fill-brand-navy transition-colors duration-300\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg></div><span class=\"font-heading font-bold text-xl text-brand-navy tracking-tight group-hover:text-brand-navy/70 transition-colors\">TugasMu</span></a><nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-1\"><a class=\"relative px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full transition-all duration-200 text-brand-navy bg-brand-lime\" href=\"/tools\">AI Tools</a><a class=\"relative px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full transition-all duration-200 text-brand-navy/70 hover:text-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-navy/5\" href=\"/harga\">Premium</a><a class=\"relative px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full transition-all duration-200 text-brand-navy/70 hover:text-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-navy/5\" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a></nav><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-3\"><a class=\"px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-navy/90 text-brand-cream font-bold text-sm transition-all shadow-sm hover:shadow-md active:scale-95 flex items-center gap-2\" href=\"/masuk\">Masuk / Daftar</a></div><div class=\"flex md:hidden items-center gap-3\"><button class=\"p-2 rounded-full text-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-navy/5 transition-colors\" aria-label=\"Toggle Menu\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></header><div class=\"bg-slate-50 border-b\"><div class=\"container py-3\"><nav class=\"flex text-sm text-slate-500\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><ol class=\"inline-flex items-center space-x-1 md:space-x-3\"><li class=\"inline-flex items-center\"><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li><div class=\"flex items-center\"><span class=\"mx-2 text-slate-400\">/</span><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/tools\">Tools</a></div></li><li><div class=\"flex items-center\"><span class=\"mx-2 text-slate-400\">/</span><span class=\"text-slate-900 font-medium\" aria-current=\"page\">Rangkuman</span></div></li></ol></nav></div></div><main class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"container py-8 md:py-12 max-w-4xl\"><div class=\"mb-8\"><h1 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4\">Buat Rangkuman</h1><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-lg\">Materi kepanjangan? Copy paste ke sini dan dapatkan poin-poin utama yang siap untuk dicatat atau dihafal.</p></div><div><form class=\"bg-white border rounded-2xl p-4 md:p-6 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"space-y-space-md mb-6\"><div class=\"space-y-space-xs\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Jenjang Pendidikan</label><div class=\"grid grid-cols-4 gap-1.5 bg-surface-container-low p-1 rounded-xl\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">SD</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">SMP</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">SMA</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">SMK</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">MADRASAH</button></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-space-md\"><div class=\"space-y-space-xs\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Kelas</label><div class=\"relative\"><select class=\"w-full h-11 px-3.5 pr-10 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container outline-none transition-all appearance-none disabled:opacity-50\" disabled=\"\" required=\"\"><option value=\"\" disabled=\"\" selected=\"\">Pilih Kelas</option></select><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined pointer-events-none absolute right-3 top-2.5 text-on-surface-variant text-[20px]\">expand_more</span></div></div><div class=\"space-y-space-xs\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Mata Pelajaran</label><div class=\"relative\"><select class=\"w-full h-11 px-3.5 pr-10 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container outline-none transition-all appearance-none disabled:opacity-50\" disabled=\"\" required=\"\"><option value=\"\" disabled=\"\" selected=\"\">Pilih Mapel</option></select><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined pointer-events-none absolute right-3 top-2.5 text-on-surface-variant text-[20px]\">expand_more</span></div></div></div><div class=\"space-y-space-xs\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Kurikulum</label><div class=\"flex gap-2\"><label class=\"flex items-center gap-2 p-2 px-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low cursor-pointer hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors flex-1\"><input type=\"radio\" class=\"w-4 h-4 accent-primary-container cursor-pointer\" name=\"kurikulum\" checked=\"\" value=\"merdeka\"/><span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface\">Merdeka</span></label><label class=\"flex items-center gap-2 p-2 px-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low cursor-pointer hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors flex-1\"><input type=\"radio\" class=\"w-4 h-4 accent-primary-container cursor-pointer\" name=\"kurikulum\" value=\"k13\"/><span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface\">2013 (K13)</span></label></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-6\"><label for=\"inputText\" class=\"block text-sm font-bold text-slate-700 mb-2\">Paste Materi yang Ingin Dirangkum</label><textarea id=\"inputText\" rows=\"8\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border-slate-300 border p-4 focus:ring-sky-500 focus:border-sky-500 text-slate-800\" placeholder=\"Salin bab buku, catatan, atau artikel panjang...\" required=\"\"></textarea></div><button type=\"submit\" disabled=\"\" class=\"w-full bg-sky-600 text-white font-bold py-4 px-6 rounded-xl hover:bg-sky-700 transition-colors disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">📚 Buat Rangkuman</button></form></div><section class=\"mt-space-xl pt-space-lg flex flex-col gap-space-md\"><div class=\"mb-2\"><h2 class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[24px]\">help</span>Panduan &amp; FAQ: AI Perangkum Teks</h2><p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-1 max-w-3xl\">Pelajari cara terbaik menyingkat materi sekolah, artikel, atau bab buku panjang tanpa kehilangan inti pembahasan.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><details class=\"group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 overflow-hidden [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 md:p-5 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary-container\"><h3 class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg md:text-headline-sm md:font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold pr-4\">Cara cepat merangkum buku paket sekolah SD, SMP, dan SMA?</h3><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant group-open:-rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0\">keyboard_arrow_down</span></summary><div class=\"p-4 md:p-5 pt-0 border-t border-outline-variant/20 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed bg-surface-container-lowest animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-top-2 duration-300\"><div class=\"prose prose-sm md:prose-base prose-slate max-w-none prose-p:mb-3 prose-p:last:mb-0\"><p>Tidak perlu membaca ratusan halaman secara manual. Kamu cukup memfoto atau menyalin teks dari buku digital (PDF) / artikel sumber lalu menempelkannya ke kotak input AI Perangkum Teks TugasMu. Sistem kami akan segera mengekstrak poin-poin utama menjadi daftar ringkas yang langsung bisa dipindahkan ke buku catatan.</p></div></div></details><details class=\"group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 overflow-hidden [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 md:p-5 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary-container\"><h3 class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg md:text-headline-sm md:font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold pr-4\">Apakah AI Perangkum Teks ini bisa meringkas PDF atau materi panjang?</h3><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant group-open:-rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0\">keyboard_arrow_down</span></summary><div class=\"p-4 md:p-5 pt-0 border-t border-outline-variant/20 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed bg-surface-container-lowest animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-top-2 duration-300\"><div class=\"prose prose-sm md:prose-base prose-slate max-w-none prose-p:mb-3 prose-p:last:mb-0\"><p>Saat ini kamu bisa mem-paste teks panjang langsung ke kolom yang disediakan. Meskipun upload PDF belum didukung secara langsung, kamu dapat menyalin (copy-paste) bab per bab secara bertahap. Ini lebih disarankan agar poin penting tidak terlewat dan struktur ringkasan tetap jelas sesuai dengan pokok bahasan setiap babnya.</p></div></div></details><details class=\"group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 overflow-hidden [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 md:p-5 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary-container\"><h3 class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg md:text-headline-sm md:font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold pr-4\">Apa keunggulan merangkum materi sejarah atau biologi menggunakan AI?</h3><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant group-open:-rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0\">keyboard_arrow_down</span></summary><div class=\"p-4 md:p-5 pt-0 border-t border-outline-variant/20 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed bg-surface-container-lowest animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-top-2 duration-300\"><div class=\"prose prose-sm md:prose-base prose-slate max-w-none prose-p:mb-3 prose-p:last:mb-0\"><p>Mata pelajaran hafalan seperti Sejarah, Biologi, atau Geografi biasanya penuh dengan teks narasi deskriptif. AI Perangkum TugasMu dilatih untuk memisahkan &quot;kata-kata pengisi&quot; dari &quot;konsep esensial&quot;. Untuk Biologi, AI akan langsung membuatkan list tahapan fotosintesis. Untuk Sejarah, AI akan membuatkan garis waktu (timeline) kejadian tanpa membuang tahun dan nama tokoh penting.</p></div></div></details><details class=\"group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 overflow-hidden [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 md:p-5 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary-container\"><h3 class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg md:text-headline-sm md:font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold pr-4\">Apakah hasil rangkuman tetap mempertahankan poin penting Kurikulum Merdeka?</h3><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant group-open:-rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0\">keyboard_arrow_down</span></summary><div class=\"p-4 md:p-5 pt-0 border-t border-outline-variant/20 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed bg-surface-container-lowest animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-top-2 duration-300\"><div class=\"prose prose-sm md:prose-base prose-slate max-w-none prose-p:mb-3 prose-p:last:mb-0\"><p>Kurikulum Merdeka menekankan pada pemahaman literasi dan gagasan pokok. Tool ini tidak sekadar &quot;memotong teks di awal dan akhir&quot;, melainkan menganalisis ide pokok setiap paragraf (deduktif/induktif) dan menyajikannya dalam format <em>bullet points</em>. Sehingga konsep esensial yang ingin diuji oleh gurumu dipastikan tidak akan hilang.</p></div></div></details></div></section></div></main><footer class=\"bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-200 py-10 mt-auto\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6\"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-3 sm:gap-6 text-center sm:text-left\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-sky-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white\"><svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 fill-white\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg></div><span class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 text-base font-heading\">TugasMu.com</span></div><span class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500\">© 2026 TugasMu.com. Hak cipta dilindungi.</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-slate-500\"><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/\">Beranda</a><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/harga\">Premium</a><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/privasi\">Privacy Policy</a><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/syarat\">Terms of Service</a><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/kontak\">Kontak</a></div></div></div></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-37f8c22e297b04f8.js\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0]);self.__next_f.push([2,null])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/c70a6d8e0709b465.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n2:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/7eb325243a3b1d61.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"3:I[2846,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n5:I[6348,[\\\"3433\\\",\\\"static/chunks/